# This crate is its own workspace, so cargo writes a target/ here (the root `/target` ignore does
# not reach it). Creusot's own outputs (verif/, .why3find/, why3find.json) are prover artifacts a
# verify run creates and normally cleans up; ignore them so a manual `cargo creusot` can't dirty the
# tree either.
/target
/verif
/.why3find
/why3find.json
